        "name": "Jet Li: Rise to Honor",
        "summary": "Kit Yun (character model after Jet Li), soon finds himself in non-stop action, due to following a dying man's wish.\n\nCinematic storytelling with martial arts we could only see in Jet Li's movies, now as a game, leads through a dozen levels spanning Hong Kong and San Francisco while you fight out of duty, or for honor.",
