      {
        "id": 24252,
        "name": "Ghost in the Shell: Stand Alone Complex",
        "summary": "Based on the movie of the same name, Ghost in the Shell: Stand Alone Complex is a fast-action third-person shooter for up to four players. As \"Major\" Motoko Kusanagi, Batou, and Tachikoma, you can engage enemies in both multiplayer combat and single-player missions. In single-player mode, your missions involve hacking into machines and computers, controlling your enemies' minds from a distance, and using a variety of weapons to eliminate your enemies. Complete the Story mode to unlock more playable characters, costumes, and additional weapons.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4psk.jpg",
